
% Daylight

Vr: I |
a: I | IV | vi | IV |
a_turnaround: I | IV | vi | IV |
b: I | vi | IV | I |
PCh: $a $a_turnaround
Ch: $b*2
DCh: $b*2
PCh_short: $a*2
c: V | vi | IV | I |
c_turnaround: V | vi | IV | R |
bridge: $c $c_turnaround
S: [D] $Vr $PCh $Ch $DCh $Vr $PCh_short $Ch $DCh $bridge $Ch*2 $DCh*2
